    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d129-a4">

                <pb facs="0218" n="952" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg952"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure No. 5.]</seg></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Commune of Pavone Cavanese.</hi>
                </p>
                <p>The undersigned syndic hereby certifies that the family of Antonio Eusebio
                    Cobetto is as follows: <list>
                        <label>1.</label>
                        <item>Antonio Eusebio Cobetto, born at Pavone Cavanese February 1, 1871, son
                            of Giovanni Giule, deceased.</item>
                        <label>2.</label>
                        <item>Giovanni Domenico Cobetto, deceased, father.</item>
                        <label>3.</label>
                        <item>Elisabetta Boralo, daughter of Giacomo and the late Clara Cobetto,
                            born at Pavone Cavanese, June 9, 1870; married.</item>
                        <label>4.</label>
                        <item>Giovanna Cobetto, daughter of Antonio Eusebio Cobetto and Elisabetta
                            Beralo, born November 2, 1893.</item>
                    </list></p>
                <p>This certificate is issued on free paper at the request of the officer in command
                    of the police station at Qualingra.</p>
                <p>For the syndic.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Francesco Ronco</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Assessor.</hi></signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Pavone
                                Cavanese</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-08-03"><hi rendition="#italic">August 3,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
